    m_HorizontalOverflow: 0
    m_VerticalOverflow: 1
    m_LineSpacing: 1
  m_Text: "<b><color=#FF9A3C>GOAL</color></b>   Find the 3 symbol keys, open the
    Inner Sanctum, take the Heart of Eternity, then escape before the temple collapses.\n\n<b><color=#FF9A3C>CONTROLS</color></b>\nWASD
    / Arrows   Move\nMouse   Look around\nShift   Sprint (burns more fuel)\nE   Interact\nM  
    Map (shows the keys)\nEsc   Pause\n\n<b><color=#FF9A3C>TIPS</color></b>\n\u2022 
    Your torch is your life. Oil jars refuel it.\n\u2022  Sprinting burns fuel faster.\n\u2022 
    Take the Heart, then RUN."
